 detective John Hobbes sta cercando un criminale che ha già incontrato... già catturato... già ucciso."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Homicide detective John Hobbes witnesses the execution of serial killer Edgar Reese. Soon after the execution the killings start again, and they are very similar to Reese's style.","tagline":"Detective John Hobbes is searching for a criminal he's already met... already caught... and already killed."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8uwishCeKydX2ogqthoeazN5odl.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oooPzQZU7Y2GZU3qZFgewqGUEbe.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9411,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8uwishCeKydX2ogqthoeazN5odl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8uwishCeKydX2ogqthoeazN5odl.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8uwishCeKydX2ogqthoeazN5odl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8uwishCeKydX2ogqthoeazN5odl.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jP9APCwI6wVNvLAKg1Eh7FQubTP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jP9APCwI6wVNvLAKg1Eh7FQubTP.jpg","language":"it","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXtoGfnFrMhXh0PAklEs0XrkDvG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xXtoGfnFrMhXh0PAklEs0XrkDvG.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sWGqNkWVr6JWL4grHFFGV3datuQ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sWGqNkWVr6JWL4grHFFGV3datuQ.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"typ